From 3ce13333944dc6b271b8db3c73f1627c276f839a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sbwml <admin@cooluc.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:58:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] fix: resolve concurrency races, configuration fallbacks,
 and parser bugs

- pkg/concurrent_map: fix flush() using RLock instead of Lock causing concurrent map writes
- plugin/executable/black_hole: eliminate global mutex and shuffle local slices to prevent data race
- plugin/executable/sequence/fallback: return early in alwaysStandby to avoid overwriting primary results
- plugin/server: invoke args.init() across server plugins to ensure default listen ports and timeouts
- plugin/data_provider/adblock_set: support multi-domain hosts lines and trim trailing '^' separators
- mlog: restore JSON encoder support when production log mode is enabled
- add comprehensive unit tests and race checks for fallback, black_hole, servers, and mlog
